# Form chapters are both readable pauses and direct playback destinations.
EXPECT Login
TEXT demo@example.com
ENTER
EXPECT Password
TEXT_ENV APP_PASSWORD
ENTER
MARKER FORM_PROFILE
SNAPSHOT Profile form
WAIT 1500
CHOOSE Notification settings
MARKER FORM_NOTIFICATIONS
SNAPSHOT Notification settings form
WAIT 1500
CHOOSE Review and submit
MARKER FORM_REVIEW
SNAPSHOT Review form
WAIT 1500
END_SESSION
